     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">relocating<a name=\"ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs-relocating\"> </a></td><td>Relocating</td><td>The client is relocating from the area served by the transferring facility.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">closer-new-facility<a name=\"ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs-closer-new-facility\"> </a></td><td>Closeness to new facility</td><td>The receiving facility is more conveniently located for the client.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">self-transfer<a name=\"ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs-self-transfer\"> </a></td><td>Self transfer</td><td>The client independently requested or initiated transfer to another treatment site.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">stigma<a name=\"ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs-stigma\"> </a></td><td>Stigma</td><td>The client is transferring because of experienced or anticipated HIV-related stigma.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">pmtct<a name=\"ng-hiv-transfer-reason-cs-pmtct\"> </a></td><td>PMTCT</td><td>The client is transferring for prevention of mother-to-child transmission services.</td></tr></table></div>"
